  "ruleText": "Ph 1203.03 Patient Counseling. The dispensing pharmacy shall offer to counsel to the patient as required pursuant to Ph 706.03.\n\nSource. #9469, eff 5-16-09, EXPIRED: 5-16-17\n\nNew. #12485, eff 2-24-18",
